    "summary": "Evaluate $(256)^{0.16}\\cdot(256)^{0.09}$.",
    "summaryZh": "求 $(256)^{0.16}\\cdot(256)^{0.09}$ 的值。",
    "answer": "A. $4$.",
    "answerZh": "A。$4$。",
    "methods": [
      {
        "title": "Add exponents of the common base",
        "titleZh": "同底数幂相乘",
        "steps": [
          "The exponents add to $0.16+0.09=1/4$. The positive fourth root of $256$ is $4$, since $4^4=256$."
